{"id":261,"date":"2026-10-01T15:41:56","date_gmt":"2026-10-01T15:41:56","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/health\/clinical-treatments\/hair-transplantation\/","raw":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/health\/clinical-treatments\/hair-transplantation\/"},"modified":"2026-10-01T16:40:54","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T16:40:54","password":"","slug":"hair-transplantation","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/health\/clinical-treatments\/hair-transplantation\/","title":{"raw":"Hair Transplantation","rendered":"Hair Transplantation"},"content":{"raw":"<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":306,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-1024x510.jpg\" alt=\"Surgeon performing a hair transplant procedure\" class=\"wp-image-306\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:column --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair transplantation treatments<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":307,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-1024x968.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor marking the hairline before hair transplantation\" class=\"wp-image-307\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Scalp Analysis<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Before any treatment, an AI-supported digital analysis evaluates hair density and thickness, the health of individual follicles and whether they are in a growth or resting phase. This helps to choose the most suitable technique and to track your progress objectively over time.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":308,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-797x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Hairline planning for an FUE hair transplant\" class=\"wp-image-308\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Individual follicles are taken one by one from the donor area with a fine, circular micro-punch and implanted into the thinning areas. No linear scar, and a comfortable recovery.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":309,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-838x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Beard transplant planning with marked areas on the cheek\" class=\"wp-image-309\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beard and Moustache Transplant<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For a fuller, more defined beard or moustache. Follicles, usually from the back of the head, are transplanted into sparse areas. An effective option for uneven growth, scarring or hair loss caused by genetics, hormones or injury.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":310,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-750x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Eyebrow transplant procedure\" class=\"wp-image-310\"\/><\/figure>\n<!-- \/wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eyebrow Transplant<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Reshapes and strengthens thin, sparse or over-plucked eyebrows with your own hair follicles. A permanent, natural-looking alternative to make-up or microblading.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sapphire FUE<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An advanced form of FUE in which the channels are opened with blades made of sapphire crystal instead of steel. The finer, sharper blades allow very precise incisions, with less tissue trauma and swelling.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DHI (Direct Hair Implantation)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Follicles are implanted directly with a special implanter pen (Choi pen), without opening channels in advance. This allows precise control of angle, direction and depth.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation)<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A strip of skin is taken from the donor area and divided into individual follicular units. FUT allows many grafts in one session but leaves a longer linear scar, so it is used today only in selected cases.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your hair transplant with confidence<\/h2>\n<!-- \/wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:button --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<!-- \/wp:paragraph --><\/div>\n<!-- \/wp:group -->","rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-e35d3e13 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"medlux-lead wp-block-paragraph\">Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"510\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-1024x510.jpg\" alt=\"Surgeon performing a hair transplant procedure\" class=\"wp-image-306\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-1024x510.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-300x149.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-768x383.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-1536x765.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery-18x9.jpg 18w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-transplant-surgery.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair transplantation treatments<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"968\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-1024x968.jpg\" alt=\"Doctor marking the hairline before hair transplantation\" class=\"wp-image-307\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-1024x968.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-300x284.jpg 300w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-768x726.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-1536x1452.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis-13x12.jpg 13w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-analysis.jpg 1600w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Scalp Analysis<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before any treatment, an AI-supported digital analysis evaluates hair density and thickness, the health of individual follicles and whether they are in a growth or resting phase. This helps to choose the most suitable technique and to track your progress objectively over time.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"797\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-797x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Hairline planning for an FUE hair transplant\" class=\"wp-image-308\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-797x1024.jpg 797w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-234x300.jpg 234w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-768x986.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-1196x1536.jpg 1196w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue-9x12.jpg 9w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-fue.jpg 1246w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 797px) 100vw, 797px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUE (Follicular Unit Extraction)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Individual follicles are taken one by one from the donor area with a fine, circular micro-punch and implanted into the thinning areas. No linear scar, and a comfortable recovery.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"838\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-838x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Beard transplant planning with marked areas on the cheek\" class=\"wp-image-309\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-838x1024.jpg 838w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-246x300.jpg 246w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-768x938.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-1258x1536.jpg 1258w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant-10x12.jpg 10w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-beard-transplant.jpg 1310w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 838px) 100vw, 838px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beard and Moustache Transplant<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For a fuller, more defined beard or moustache. Follicles, usually from the back of the head, are transplanted into sparse areas. An effective option for uneven growth, scarring or hair loss caused by genetics, hormones or injury.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-750x1024.jpg\" alt=\"Eyebrow transplant procedure\" class=\"wp-image-310\" srcset=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-750x1024.jpg 750w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-220x300.jpg 220w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-768x1048.jpg 768w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-1125x1536.jpg 1125w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant-9x12.jpg 9w, https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/medluxlife-hair-eyebrow-transplant.jpg 1172w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Eyebrow Transplant<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Reshapes and strengthens thin, sparse or over-plucked eyebrows with your own hair follicles. A permanent, natural-looking alternative to make-up or microblading.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Sapphire FUE<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An advanced form of FUE in which the channels are opened with blades made of sapphire crystal instead of steel. The finer, sharper blades allow very precise incisions, with less tissue trauma and swelling.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">DHI (Direct Hair Implantation)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Follicles are implanted directly with a special implanter pen (Choi pen), without opening channels in advance. This allows precise control of angle, direction and depth.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FUT (Follicular Unit Transplantation)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A strip of skin is taken from the donor area and divided into individual follicular units. FUT allows many grafts in one session but leaves a longer linear scar, so it is used today only in selected cases.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-5e4b10ce wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your hair transplant with confidence<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/medluxlife-6j8sz55bpn.live-website.com\/contact\/\">Request a Free Consultation<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/wa.me\/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer wp-block-paragraph\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false,"block_version":1},"excerpt":{"raw":"","rendered":"<p>Hair transplantation moves healthy hair follicles from areas where hair is resistant to thinning, usually the back and sides of the head, to areas with thinning or hair loss. It is one of the most requested aesthetic procedures for men and women with pattern hair loss, and the results grow naturally with your own hair. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":258,"menu_order":2,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"page-with-title","meta":{"footnotes":""},"permalink_template":"http